\section{Routine QC and anomaly thresholds}{

These settings determine flags/coverage decisions rather than deleting
scientific rows. QC execution success, coverage pass and grain eligibility
are separate outputs. The following are the defaults, not recommendations
to change study criteria. See \code{\link[=qc_appusage_day]{qc_appusage_day()}} and \code{\link[=assess_appusage_qc]{assess_appusage_qc()}}.\tabular{ll}{
   Setting \tab Default \cr
   \code{qc$enabled} \tab \code{TRUE} \cr
   \code{qc$require_all_weekdays} \tab \code{TRUE} \cr
   \code{qc$min_nonempty_days} \tab \code{7} \cr
   \code{qc$use_all_apps_row} \tab \code{FALSE} \cr
   \code{qc$drop_likely_total_all_rows} \tab \code{TRUE} \cr
   \code{qc$all_row_tolerance} \tab \code{0.10} \cr
   \code{qc$max_episode_ms} \tab \code{86400000} \cr
   \code{qc$max_daily_app_ms} \tab \code{86400000} \cr
   \code{qc$max_daily_total_ms} \tab \code{86400000} \cr
   \code{qc$max_export_lookback_days} \tab \code{31} \cr
   \code{qc$meta_diff_abs_ms} \tab \code{60000} \cr
   \code{qc$meta_diff_ratio} \tab \code{0.20} \cr
}

\itemize{
\item \code{qc$enabled}: Logical: execute routine source QC.
\item \code{qc$require_all_weekdays}: Logical: require Monday through Sunday among nonempty dates.
\item \code{qc$min_nonempty_days}: Minimum count of days with positive valid use.
\item \code{qc$use_all_apps_row}: Logical: use the exported ALL total for daily QC instead of summing application rows.
\item \code{qc$drop_likely_total_all_rows}: Logical: omit likely multi-day ALL totals from daily QC.
\item \code{qc$all_row_tolerance}: Relative tolerance used to recognize a likely ALL total.
\item \code{qc$max_episode_ms}: Episode-duration anomaly threshold, milliseconds (24 hours).
\item \code{qc$max_daily_app_ms}: App/day-duration anomaly threshold, milliseconds.
\item \code{qc$max_daily_total_ms}: Summed source/day-duration anomaly threshold, milliseconds.
\item \code{qc$max_export_lookback_days}: Expected maximum record-to-export lookback, days.
\item \code{qc$meta_diff_abs_ms}: Absolute meta summary/episode discrepancy threshold, milliseconds.
\item \code{qc$meta_diff_ratio}: Relative meta summary/episode discrepancy threshold.
}
